# Baseline agent ignore file for 8fold PHP projects.
#
# Every project has a .copilotignore that starts from this file; see the
# Security section of AGENTS.md. Uses .gitignore syntax: patterns without a
# slash match at any depth.

# Credentials and key/certificate material. These patterns apply at any depth.
auth.json
*.pem
*.key

# Secret environment files: `.env` and `.env-*`.
.env
.env-*

# Committed, secret-free templates. Projects name their templates in
# docs/agent-context.md and add any others here.
!.env-example
